    "code": "\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectVisible? THEN\n\t\t\tDO ApproachObject\n\tELSE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectWithinReach? THEN\n\t\t\tDO TakeObject\n\tELSE\n\t\t\tIF CheckObjectMaterial? THEN\n\t\t\tDO PerformSpecificTask\n\tEND\n"
